      "claim": "The query is a fentanyl-class 4-anilidopiperidine; the closest measured opioid context, meperidine, had F=0.80 in cirrhosis (C07, C14), and L2 indicates cirrhosis increases its systemic availability by 81% (C17), implying a normal-condition estimate still above the 20% threshold.",
      "card_ids": ["C07", "C14", "C17"]
